#: ../../source/quickstart.md:111
msgid ""
"Use `ketu.core.aspects` (the aspect-type table) here, **not** "
"`ketu.aspects`. Because `ketu/aspects/` is a subpackage, `from "
"ketu.aspects import ...` binds the name `ketu.aspects` to that module — "
"so `ketu.aspects[\"name\"]` would raise `TypeError: 'module' object is "
"not subscriptable`. The structured table always lives at "
"`ketu.core.aspects`."
msgstr ""
"Utilise ici `ketu.core.aspects` (la table des types d'aspects), **et non** "
"`ketu.aspects`. Comme `ketu/aspects/` est un sous-paquet, `from "
"ketu.aspects import ...` lie le nom `ketu.aspects` à ce module — "
"si bien que `ketu.aspects[\"name\"]` lèverait `TypeError: 'module' object "
"is not subscriptable`. La table structurée se trouve toujours à "
"`ketu.core.aspects`."

